# =====================================================================================================================
# NetSim Lab .gitignore
#
# Rule of thumb used here: ignore by LOCATION and by KIND OF FILE-THAT-IS-ALWAYS-GENERATED, never by data extension.
# .csv / .json / .png / .joblib files are real, tracked project content in this repo (example results, JSON schemas,
# frontend test fixtures, the trained model bundle, README screenshots), so they are NOT ignored globally.
# =====================================================================================================================

# --- Python ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.venv/
venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# --- Node / frontend --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/.vite/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
# NOTE: frontend/package-lock.json is deliberately NOT ignored. Commit it after the first `make frontend-install`.

# --- Secrets and local configuration ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# --- Runtime output (everything the app, the CLI tools and the campaigns write while running) ---------------------------
# API database + one directory per experiment, campaign output, generated ML data, demo runs, ...
data/*
!data/.keep_dir
# scripts/stack.sh: pid files and logs
.run/

# --- Generated reports (rewritten on every run, machine-specific, produce noisy diffs) -------------------------------
docs/TEST_REPORT.md
docs/test_results.json
docs/e2e_browser_results.json

# --- Release archives and packaging leftovers --------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz

# --- Logs, captures and scratch ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
*.pcap
*.pcapng
*.tmp
*.bak

# --- Editors and operating systems -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.directory

# =====================================================================================================================
# OPTIONAL: keep the repository small.
# examples/experiments/stage7/runs/ holds ~100 MB of raw CSV/JSON (2,500+ files) of the 372-run example campaign. It is
# tracked by default so that `make exp-analyze` and `make exp-reproduce` work straight after cloning. If you prefer a
# lightweight repository, uncomment the next line and run:   git rm -r --cached examples/experiments/stage7/runs
# The runs can always be regenerated with `make exp-example`.
# =====================================================================================================================
# examples/experiments/stage7/runs/
examples/experiments/stage7/runs/